e se formó la banda en 1968. El evento concluyó con las últimas actuaciones en vivo tanto de Black Sabbath como del cantante Ozzy Osbourne; también marcó la primera vez desde 2005 que la formación original de la banda (Osbourne, Tony Iommi, Geezer Butler y Bill Ward) había actuado juntos en vivo. Osbourne, que ya no podía caminar debido a la enfermedad avanzada de Parkinson, cantaba mientras estaba sentada en un trono. Diecisiete días después del espectáculo, Osbourne murió a la edad de 76 años. El beneficio recaudado ascendió a 140 millones de euros, y será donado a Acorns Children's Hospice, Birmingham Children's Hospital y Cure Parkinson.","status":"In Production","country":null,"genres":["Música","Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1515139","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:56.424Z"},{"id":"movie-1596296","slug":"movie-1596296","title":"The History of Concrete","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2GWR1g1VdUNnNpLh6XfAQ6LVfyd.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1596296","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:56.717Z"},{"id":"movie-1498072","slug":"movie-1498072","title":"八月の終わり、性の目覚め 石川澪","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sFYTjIpkQje77LWR7odZRG7jVxK.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1498072","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:17:56.989Z"},{"id":"movie-1125627","slug":"movie-1125627","title":"DreamQuil","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dVuxzF8odLaajzUk5SC4vRub7aL.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Misterio","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1125627","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movi