.998Z"},{"id":"movie-1291712","slug":"movie-1291712","title":"Las catadoras de Hitler","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t0L4h1PMFBzQLQETruTCH4VcpqK.jpg","synopsis":"Otoño de 1943. La joven Rosa huye de un Berlín bombardeado y se refugia en un pueblo donde viven sus suegros. Rosa descubre rápidamente que en el bosque adyacente se encuentra el cuartel general de Hitler, la llamada 'Guarida del Lobo'. El Führer ve enemigos por todas partes. Su obsesión es que lo envenenen. Una mañana Rose es recogida junto a otras jóvenes del pueblo para probar la comida que le preparan a Hitler.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1291712","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:21:01.269Z"},{"id":"movie-1773587","slug":"movie-1773587","title":"Conspiración policial: El asesinato del agente J","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vAxYdcUh1MlZbidvGtYEHj0yLc2.jpg","synopsis":"Un joven agente aparece muerto en la vivienda de un general. La investigación revela un encubrimiento que alcanza a la cúpula de la Policía Nacional de Indonesia","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1773587","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:21:01.543Z"},{"id":"movie-1647409","slug":"movie-1647409","title":"Desperada","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lE0kyuREJoqWFXPjX5oooGH5Dt0.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1647409","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:21:01.813Z"},{"id":"movie-1135582","slug":"movie-1135582","title":"Dao","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4wiscRFdQwiWhdOEK9mwCbccdgc.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"http